000900******************************************************
001000*                                                    *
001100*   S D E L S I T M                   PU2-5          *
001200*                                                    *
001300*   THIS SUB PROGRAM DELETES ITEMS FROM PO           *
001400*                                                    *
001500******************************************************
001600*   N O T E    T H I S   S U B R O U T I N E   I S   *
001700*         C A L L E D    B Y :                       *
001800*      1. SPOMOD                                     *
001900******************************************************
      *C  07/17/1996   CA YODER
      *C    RE-COMPILED TO PICK UP CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C  11/22/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C    DELETE DRCVTRAK RECORDS FOR DELETED ITEM.
      *C
      *C   05/21/98  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED CALL TO "SCALCBGT" TO CALCULATE THE CORRECT
      *C   BUDGET AMOUNT FOR THE PO.  DECATUR FOUND THAT THE
      *C   TAX WAS NOT BEING INCLUDED IN THE CALCULATION.
      *C
      *C   09/18/03  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK FOR INVOICES FOR NON-RECEIVABLE
      *C   PURCHASE ORDERS.
      *C
      *C   09/23/03  CA YODER
      *C   FOR TMS PLANTS, DO NOT ALLOW DELETE OF LAST ITEM ON PO.
      *C   NEED TO DELETE ENTIRE PO.
      *C
002000
008600
008700 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
008800 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
