096500
      **************************
      *                        *
      *  FIND ALL DRCVTRAK     *
      *  RECORDS FOR THE ITEM  *
      *  AND DELETE THEM       *
      *                        *
      **************************

           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PO-ARG TO PORCVNO OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O.
           MOVE DE5-ITEM TO ITEMNO OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O.
           MOVE ZEROS TO SEQNO OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O.
           START DRCVTRAK-O KEY NOT < EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   GO TO 66-UNLOCK-DRCVTRAK
               ELSE
                   MOVE "FIND DRCVTRAK * 66-FD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

       66-GET-DRCVTRAK.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DRCVTRAK-O NEXT INTO BUF-DRCVTRAK.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
              IF RCVTRAK-PO-RCV-NO NOT = PO-ARG OR
                 RCVTRAK-ITEM-NUMBER NOT = DE5-ITEM
                    MOVE "10" TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               DELETE DRCVTRAK-O
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                 MOVE "DELETE DRCVTRAK * 66-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                 GO TO 2-BLOWUP
               ELSE
                 GO TO 66-GET-DRCVTRAK
           ELSE
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                    NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
                  MOVE "GET DRCVTRAK * 66-GD" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   GO TO 2-BLOWUP.

       66-UNLOCK-DRCVTRAK.
      *------ DO A START ON DRCVTRAK TO FREE UP LOCKS
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PORCVNO OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O
                               ITEMNO OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O
                               SEQNO OF DRCVTRAK-REC-O.
           START DRCVTRAK-O KEY > EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

096600     GO TO 66-DELETE-ITEM.
096700
096800 66-DI-X.
096900     EXIT.
097100
097200
