101900     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
102000         MOVE "FIND DREQD * 662-MR" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
102100         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
102200
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ DREQD-O NEXT INTO BUF-DREQD
               AT END MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS = "10" OR "14" OR "46"
                   MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD
               ELSE
                   MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD.
           IF REQNO OF DREQD-REC-O NOT = REQ-ARG
               MOVE 15 TO COND-WORD.
